/CHANGES TO FOCAL-12 TO ALLOW THE
/LOADING AND STARTING OF AN 
/ASSEMBLY LANGUAGE PROGRAM
/USING THE NEW LIBRARY COMMAND 
/L B,NAME,UNIT
/
/
/ASSEMBLY LANGUAGE PROGRAM MUST BE 
/SAVED AS A SELF-STARTING PROGRAM
/I.E. SB NAME,UNIT,P00200
/
/MAY BE EITHER LMODE OR PMODE.
/MUST BE USING DIAL-MS 
/
/
/KEITH WHITTLE
/DECEMBER 28,1971
